	(text "Power backpack connector contract (kicad-pedal-lib Backpack_Power_v1):\nJ1 = P cluster (origin), pins run +y:  P1 +9V raw   P2 GND   P3 GND   P4 +9VA (filtered out)\nJ3 = A cluster, x = -7 mm, pin 1 on row 3:  A1 -9VA   A2 GND   A3 GND   A4 +VAUX\nRails this backpack does not generate stay as they are here (PWR_FLAG only) - delete what you do not drive.\nOutline 32.0 x 39.3 mm; body 32 x 17.4 below the 12 mm tongue that carries J1/J3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 27.94 0)
		(effects
